  "_readme": "Paste ONE event (the value, not the key) into the Lambda console Test tab. Replace REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_DEMO_PASSCODE with your DEMO_PASSCODE, and make 'origin' equal ALLOWED_ORIGIN. Expected results are in lambda/README.md.",
